{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.70, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year`: `scale-county-timeagg-weekday` (January, April, July and October 2020, the weekday alone, all 24 hours) under `<aggregateBy key=\"Year\"/>`, output Year. MOVESOutput is 6,288 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is a whole-week, whole-year cell built from fewer day types than the week: the input merge cuts startsPerDay, startsHourFraction, startsOpModeDistribution and the hotelling tables to the selected day before PreAggMONTH.sql collapses them, and PreAggYEAR.sql then collapses the months, while the travel it weighs by is the whole week's (PLAN.md §7.3.66, §7.3.70).\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1 and `db_aggregationmonth` is the RunSpec's months, read from its XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py`. `n_outputRate` is bound to 6288, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "year-aggregation"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 0 -- PreAggYEAR.sql's SYNTHESIZED `Whole Year`. The RunSpec selects January, April, July and October (`db_aggregationmonth`).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./selections/scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year-month.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE MONTHS THE RUNSPEC SELECTED, monthIDs 1, 4, 7 and 10, read out of the RunSpec XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py` into `runspecs/selections/scale-county-timeagg-weekday-year-month.parquet`: MOVES overwrites the month list with MonthOfAnyYear 0 after PreAggYEAR.sql has collapsed the month tables over these (ExecutionRunSpec.java:424-445). It overrides the default database catalogue's entry, every month of MonthOfAnyYear.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
